02:0003DC82 674E            	  9783:     beq  _L_z04_Manhandla_CheckCollisions_Exit
02:0003DC84 4EB90004BC88    	  9784:     jsr     ResetShoveInfo
                            	  9785:     ; Don't let the base die on its own.
